cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the catalogue it produces, please cite the paper below."
title: "Radio_PNe_Pipeline_LMC: a radio-continuum catalogue and radio PNLF for planetary nebulae in the LMC"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for a radio-continuum catalogue of planetary nebulae in the
  Large Magellanic Cloud, built from MeerKAT 1.295 GHz and ASKAP-EMU 888 MHz
  observations, and for the first radio planetary nebula luminosity function
  of the LMC.
type: software
